            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average technology\n\n# Included processes\nThe inventory includes the actual energy consumption of a goods train in Switzerland using electro energy. In addition also the diesel consumption and emissions of shunting processes, the production and maintenance of vehicles as well as the construction and maintenance of the rail way tracks are accounted for.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
